nodeskclaw-meeting 1.0.0rc1

An independent Tencent Meeting application and permission gateway extension for
loudon84/nodeskclaw. Repository structure and integration interfaces were examined
at commit 83edfb0d97f07920deb8bb9ce44a91e3e32cc3af. The upstream repository uses the
Apache License, Version 2.0. Preserve upstream notices when integrating this code.

This archive contains newly produced extension code, tests, integration modules,
and design documents. It does not bundle Tencent software, upstream credentials,
Python/npm dependencies, font files, or the full NoDeskClaw repository.

Tencent Meeting names and service interfaces remain associated with their
respective owners. No affiliation, certification, Tencent account entitlement,
or endorsement is represented by this source distribution.
